                  <description align="center" color="transparent" colored="true" height="333" resized="false" width="221" x="116" y="523">The process restricts switching within the same equipment category (e.g., VHP, BFW, Air Compressors) but allows switching between different categories (e.g., motor to turbine). This control is achieved by adding specific constraints, variables, and parameters to the existing flow.&lt;br/&gt;&lt;br/&gt;I/P 1: actual data&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;Stored:&lt;br&gt;1. equipment_initial&lt;br&gt;2. mustrun_avalable</description>
